I can see the bug in the `Contains` function in `repair.go`. The issue is on line 4:

```go
for i := 0; i < len(xs)-1; i++ {
```

This loop condition excludes the last element because it uses `len(xs)-1` instead of `len(xs)`. The function should check all elements including the last one.

Let me fix this bug:
